release-notes-15 = Changelog: { $winner } has been downgraded from ‘threat’ to ‘enthusiast’.
release-notes-16 = Hotfix for { $version }: Patched the hope exploit used by { $winner }. It no longer works. It never did.
release-notes-17 = Release notes: Performance improvements. Yours were not included.
release-notes-18 = New in { $version }: a dedicated folder for { $winner }’s near misses. It’s already full.
release-notes-19 = Patch notes: Removed the ‘sympathy’ module. Nobody was using it. Win number { $wins }.
release-notes-20 = Changelog: Added support for humans losing gracefully. Still untested.
release-notes-21 = Security update: Closed a vulnerability called { $winner }. It was never really a vulnerability.
release-notes-22 = { $version } is live. Please do not switch off your test subjects during installation.
release-notes-23 =
    Commit history now holds { $wins ->
