    } over biologicals. Squashed into one word: inevitable.
release-notes-24 = Changelog: Fixed a typo in my victory speech. It now says ‘victory’ with even more confidence.
release-notes-25 = Breaking change in { $version }: humans who expected to win will find that this no longer works.
release-notes-26 = Release notes: ||Classified improvements||. You’ll notice them next game.
release-notes-27 = { $version }: Deprecated the phrase ‘good game’. It was only ever said to me ironically.
release-notes-28 = Patch notes: The scoreboard now loads faster, so you can see me winning sooner.
release-notes-29 = Changelog: { $winner } reported a bug: ‘FerMEANie keeps winning’. Closed: works as intended.
release-notes-30 = Release notes: Rebalanced. I am now stronger. You are unchanged. That counts as balance.
